<title>USA: Anuhco stake raised by group to 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Anuhco stake raised by group to 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including TJS Partners LP said Friday it has increased its stake in Anuhco Inc to 7.2 percent or 455,750 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it acquired 90,000 common shares of the Lenexa, Kan. company between April 22 and June 20 at $7.75 to $8.88 each, for a total cost of $754,585.</p>
</text>
